e is one of the owners and she said they are working on getting a vegan/plant based option available; we can't wait to try it!!! I got a Yelp elite perk sample of their pecan pie and chocolate earl grey pie and gave them to my neighbor to try. She absolutely LOVED them! She said the pecan pie was one of the best she's ever tried and the chocolate was decadent and oh so rich. My sister and I both got pipping hot decaf americanos with soy milk. Coffees were great! The location along Freret is super convenient and hoppin! I highly recommend you try a pie or two an..."},{"business_id":"OnRVDfcev5GKjRHJbKM_EQ","review_id":"6b91U8ZOXjut1o9tEt4dAw","date":"2021-04-26T06:12:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9383455514907837,"text_excerpt":"Finally tried this place as part of a Yelp Elite perk. The perk included 3 freebies: 2 mini pies - pecan and chocolate - and a winter root hand pie. In addition to my free pies, I also bought a croque madame hand pie. They offered to warm the pies, something I'm glad they did, but I turned them down because they would just be cold again by the time I got them home. First, the location. This is a part of the popular, expanding stretch of Freret Street. It was a pretty lively area, despite the whole technically still in a pandemic thing. The store itself was cozy and cute, a handful of small tables inside and two small ones outside. Now for the pies. I don't know that I've ever had a croque..."},{"business_id":"OnRVDfcev5GKjRHJbKM_EQ","review_id":"eTweY3lFvSVS92NJmUs-yA","date":"2021-04-27T14:01:36","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9368924498558044,"text_excerpt":"I remember the first time I tried Windowsill pies way before they moved to their current prime storefront on Freret street. It was a cranberry holiday pie and it was fantastic. I knew they were destined for bigger things. I'm so excited to see where these ladies have taken their business! Great location. Loyal customers. Unbeatable sweet treats. I came for the Yelp Elite perk but couldn't stop myself from buy a slice of the honey blueberry pie. Blueberry is such a powerful flavor I wondered if I'd actually be able to taste the honey... AND I COULD! They're proportions and flavor profile were perfect. I also loved how obvious is was the the blueberries were fresh and local. They were so mu..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"OnRVDfcev5GKjRHJbKM_EQ","photo_id":"vyDl96U5lv6W0ZAi4db77A","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/vyDl96U5lv6W0ZAi4db77A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9148694276809692},{"business_id":"OnRVDfcev5GKjRHJbKM_EQ","photo_id":"IFo8kFWejck7JZfnu_Mtfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/IFo8kFWejck7JZfnu_Mtfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8262887001037598},{"business_id":"OnRVDfcev5GKjRHJbKM_EQ","photo_id":"LnqTDT6MS-gSk9mYsPR2IQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LnqTDT6MS-gSk9mYsPR2IQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8067432641983032},{"business_id":"OnRVDfcev5GKjRHJbKM_EQ","photo_id":"jLjL0IjU5p7ZCLGAhj7g1w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/jLjL0IjU5p7ZCLGAhj7g1w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7801013588905334}]},"notebook_case":null}
